# Kept in git, but no reason to ship them to the CDN.
reference/
design/
verification/
node_modules/
.env*
.git/
.codex/
.agents/
.thumbnail

# The lesson loads recordings.js, recorded-player.js and the 75 mp3s at
# runtime, so voiceovers/ must ship — excluding the folder wholesale left the
# live site with no recorded voice at all. Only the working files stay behind.
voiceovers/*.cjs
voiceovers/*.txt
voiceovers/*.md
voiceovers/narrator-lines.json
voiceovers/narrator-lines.csv

# Character pack: 12 MB of source sheets, of which the lesson ships only the
# expressions Swiftee actually plays. build-swiftee.cjs copies those into
# assets/swiftee/ (~1.3 MB) and generates the sheet table from the manifest, so
# the pack itself stays out of the deploy. Re-run it if the pack changes.
